WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,760
Don't talk nonsense. It's not that I don't have it.

2
00:00:01,760 --> 00:00:04,340
Okay, okay, you don’t have it. I’ll be there tomorrow afternoon.

3
00:00:04,740 --> 00:00:07,060
Please tell me her birthday and horoscope first and I will check.

4
00:00:07,460 --> 00:00:08,660
It has been sent to your mobile phone

5
00:00:11,350 --> 00:00:18,140
Can you tell which one it is now?

6
00:00:18,140 --> 00:00:20,620
My master will arrive tomorrow. Don't worry. It's just for convenience.

7
00:00:20,620 --> 00:00:21,900
Let's find a place to stay first

8
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:26,800
What's wrong? Didn't sleep well?

9
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:28,080
i had a dream

10
00:00:28,280 --> 00:00:30,480
I dreamed about a very tall dog, very big

11
00:00:30,480 --> 00:00:32,280
The blood spurting from the big mouth has been chasing me

12
00:00:32,280 --> 00:00:33,240
Chase me to the cliff

13
00:00:33,240 --> 00:00:34,560
It's okay if I fall down

14
00:00:35,440 --> 00:00:36,960
This should be your worry

15
00:00:36,960 --> 00:00:38,080
Lao Liu will arrive in the afternoon

16
00:00:38,080 --> 00:00:39,320
Don't be afraid, we're here

17
00:00:40,170 --> 00:00:41,250
Xiaotie is right

18
00:00:41,850 --> 00:00:43,130
This is the hatred behind you

19
00:00:43,450 --> 00:00:45,330
He sensed that you were going to take action

20
00:00:45,330 --> 00:00:46,250
Coming to cause trouble

21
00:00:46,250 --> 00:00:48,610
Did any of your ancestors pay tribute to the public?

22
00:00:48,610 --> 00:00:49,930
I heard my mother say

23
00:00:49,930 --> 00:00:51,850
My grandma seems to have offered sacrifices to the public servant

24
00:00:51,850 --> 00:00:53,850
But I don’t know why I stopped offering it.

25
00:00:54,370 --> 00:00:55,610
I know it well

26
00:00:55,610 --> 00:00:56,850
You don't have to be afraid

27
00:00:56,850 --> 00:00:58,410
There's me and Xiaotie here

28
00:00:58,410 --> 00:00:59,370
No one dares to hurt you

29
00:01:00,010 --> 00:01:01,610
You should sign up

30
00:01:01,610 --> 00:01:02,730
When a church should be established, a church should be established
